    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a side-scrolling action game where you control a whale to avoid marine plastic waste.<br>Players take control of the whale.<br>Clicking the mouse button makes the whale ascend, and releasing it makes the whale descend.<br>As the game begins, marine plastic waste will flow in from the side, and the goal is to avoid colliding with it.<br>Occasionally, random boxes will appear. Touching one will summon an assist character to help the whale.<br>Your score is determined by how many seconds you survive.</p>",
